1. Product Overview
AI CV Parser & Matching Assistant is a lightweight, AI-powered tool designed to automate the initial screening of job candidates.
It extracts structured information from CVs, analyzes candidate skills and experience, compares them with a job description (JD), and generates a concise summary and a match score.
Its purpose is to reduce manual screening time, improve consistency in candidate evaluation, and provide quick insights for HR professionals and hiring managers.

2. Problem Statement
HR teams and recruiters spend significant time performing repetitive tasks:

manually reading CVs,
identifying key information (skills, experience, languages),
comparing it to requirements in job descriptions,
writing summaries for hiring managers,
scoring candidate fit qualitatively.

This process is time-consuming, inconsistent, and error-prone.
The product aims to eliminate 60–80% of this manual workload by automating extraction, evaluation, and summarization.

3. Product Goals
✅ Primary Goals

Automate CV text extraction and structuring.
Extract job requirements from JD text.
Generate scoring logic matching candidate ↔ role.
Provide a concise summary suitable for hiring managers.
Make it usable within minutes (Streamlit UI).

✅ Secondary Goals

Enable batch processing of multiple CVs.
Export structured results to ATS systems.
Generate professional PDF reports.

✅ Non-Goals (not included now)

Full ATS replacement
Candidate interview automation
CV rewriting or generative content for candidates


